<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>You've been invited to {{appName}}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #f6f8fa; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 28px 32px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .header { color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .header h2 { margin: 0; }
    .credentials { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 16px 18px; border-left: 4px solid #3498db; border-radius: 4px; margin: 18px 0; font-family: Consolas, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; }
    .credentials div { margin: 4px 0; word-break: break-all; }
    .credentials strong { color: #111; }
    .steps { padding-left: 22px; }
    .steps li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .button { background: #3498db; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 12px 22px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin: 18px 0; font-weight: 600; }
    .warning { background: #fff4e5; border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; color: #663c00; margin: 18px 0; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Welcome to {{appName}}, {{firstName}}!</h2>
    </div>

    <p>You've been added to <strong>{{appName}}</strong> as a <strong>{{roleLabel}}</strong>. Your account is ready — use the credentials below to sign in.</p>

    <div class="credentials">
      <div><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</div>
      <div><strong>Temporary password:</strong> {{password}}</div>
    </div>

    <p><strong>How to log in:</strong></p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Open <a href="{{loginUrl}}">{{loginUrl}}</a> in your browser.</li>
      <li>Enter the email address and temporary password shown above.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Log In</strong> to access your dashboard.</li>
      <li>Go to your profile settings and change your password to something only you know.</li>
    </ol>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
      <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Log In Now</a>
    </p>

    <div class="warning">
      <strong>Security tip:</strong> This temporary password was generated just for you. Please change it immediately after your first login, and never share it with anyone.
    </div>

    <p>If you weren't expecting this invitation or have any trouble signing in, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
